        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Backwards compatibility is there, whoever wants to have fixed small width value can do so.\r\nThere aren't many people who are aware of zL and zH.\r\nMaybe we can get to a compromise regarding the way this feature is enabled?\r\nInstead of setting individual width props to 0 we can have a separate option like `dynamic_width: boolean` which will be applied to all three window types (nofocus, focus and preview)?\r\n\r\nAnyway, I love your plugin, great job and an idea to edit things like it's just another text buffer",
